  "Zerodha's Console serves P and L, tradebooks and tax reports to millions of users, from databases holding hundreds of billions of rows. Some reports are a one-line SELECT; others are hundreds of lines of JOINs. One finishes in 10 milliseconds, the next takes 10 seconds or more. Users pull millions of them a day.": [
